== the IP-literal fetch, with its cause ==
### IP literal in the URL under --allow-net=160.79.104.10:443
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=160.79.104.10:443 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-net.ts https://160.79.104.10/v1/messages
ERROR TypeError: fetch failed
  cause 1: Error: error sending request for url (https://160.79.104.10/v1/messages): client error (Connect): received fatal alert: HandshakeFailure
EXIT=0

### the hostname under the IP grant, with its cause
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=160.79.104.10:443 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-net.ts https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
ERROR NotCapable: Requires net access to "api.anthropic.com:443", run again with the --allow-net flag
EXIT=0

